loobric1 — Loobric demo machine
===============================

A small simulated 3-axis metric mill used to demo the Loobric LinuxCNC
client (loobric-linuxcnc). It is the stock AXIS sim plus the GladeVCP
example panel and a small local tool table (loobric1.tbl, 5 tools,
T1 is a touch probe).

This config represents a machine that has NEVER communicated with a
Loobric server: no keys, no bindings, no client configuration. The
loobric-linuxcnc client is installed and configured separately, by hand,
as part of the demo.

Run it:

    linuxcnc configs/sim/axis/loobric1/loobric1.ini

The panel files (manual-example.ui, manual-example.hal, hitcounter.py)
are symlinks to the shared copies in configs/sim/, same as the
configs/sim/axis/gladevcp/ example.
